pages.Archaeologist:
[[File:Archaeologist.png|thumb|280px|''the '''Archaeologist''' inspecting runes'']]
{{Tocright}}

The '''Archaeologist''' is a [[:Category:Quests|quest-giving]] [[NPCs|NPC]] located beside the {{Enchant Altar}}, alongside the [[Archaeologist?]].  
They are attempting to decipher ancient runes and enlist the player's help in experimenting with minerals.  

== Quests ==  
{{Quest
|Quest = Mysterious Altar
|QuestSub = The runes mention strange catalysts.
|QuestStep1 = [[Enchanting|Enchant]] your [[Pans|pan]] with either [[Minerals|Aurorite]] or [[Minerals|Aetherite]]
|Rewards = {{$|250,000}} • {{EXP|10,000}} • {{Meteor Shards|250}}
}}

== Dialogue ==
{{Dialogue Start}}
:'''Archaeologist:''' Hmm… if I can figure out what this means, I can decipher the rest…  

:{{Choice|What are you doing?}}  
::'''Archaeologist:''' I’m trying to figure out what these symbols mean.  
::'''Archaeologist:''' I believe they hold the key to the purpose of this altar.  

:{{Choice|Maybe I can help.}}  
::'''Archaeologist:''' Hmm, alright. I’ve managed to decipher the words *Aurorite* and *Aetherite*.  
::'''Archaeologist:''' Maybe those are the catalysts?  
::'''Archaeologist:''' I don’t know much about minerals, but maybe your prospecting knowledge can help.  
::;(Quest started: '''Mysterious Altar''')  

:{{Choice|...}}  
::'''Archaeologist:''' These runes won’t solve themselves, you know.  
{{Dialogue End}}

[[Category:NPCs]]  
[[Category:Quests]]  
[[Category:Enchant Altar]]

pages.Beachgoer:
[[File:Beachgoer.png|thumb|280px|''the '''Beachgoer''' standing in front of a palm tree'']]
{{Tocright}}
The '''Beachgoer''' is an [[NPCs|NPC]] located at {{Sunset Beach}}. She is irritated by the influx of prospectors and confused by the nearby [[Pirate]].  

She also shows up - in a much happier frame of mind - at {{Seashell Isle}} during the Summer Event. 

== Dialogue ==

=== Sunset Beach ===
{{Dialogue Start}}
:'''Beachgoer''': Tch... These prospectors are ruining the beach.  
:'''Beachgoer''': And what's with that guy over there? Is he cosplaying as a pirate?  
{{Dialogue End}}

=== Seashell Beach ===
{{Dialogue Start}}
:'''Beachgoer''': Wow, the breeze feels great!
:'''Beachgoer''': This is the life!
{{Dialogue End}}

[[Category:NPCs]] [[Category:Sunset Beach]]

pages.Anne:
