pages.Cave Diver:
[[File:Cave Diver.png|250px|thumb|The Cave Diver in the Astral Caverns]]
{{Tocright}}
The '''Cave Diver''' can be found <strike>risking his life</strike>[ahem, sorry] ''exploring'' a flooded underground passage off of the {{Astral Caverns}}. If you help him fix his boat, he can use the underground route to take you to the {{Sunscorched Desert}}.

He seems a bit surprised when the passage ''works'', mind you, so ... caveat emptor.
[[File:Cave Diver with boat.png|300px|thumb|The Cave Diver waiting for an intrepid Prospector to fix his boat]]

== Quest ==
{{Quest
|Quest = Underground Passage [1]
|QuestSub = Repair the boat to traverse the flooded cavern.
|QuestStep1 = Collect 50 [[Mythril]].
|QuestStep2 = Collect 500 [[Palladium]].
}}

{{Quest
|Quest = Underground Passage [2]
|QuestSub = Repair the boat to traverse the flooded cavern.
|QuestStep1 = Talk to the Cave Diver.
}}

{{Quest
|Quest = Underground Passage [3]
|QuestSub = Repair the boat to traverse the flooded cavern.
|QuestStep1 = Collect 200 [[Inferlume]].
|QuestStep2 = Collect 100 [[Volcanic Core]].
}}

{{Quest
|Quest = Underground Passage [4]
|QuestSub = Repair the boat to traverse the flooded cavern.
|QuestStep1 = Talk to the Cave Diver.
}}

{{Quest
|Quest = Underground Passage [5]
|QuestSub = Repair the boat to traverse the flooded cavern.
|QuestStep1 = Bring 3 [[Umbrite]] to the Cave Diver.
|QuestStep2 = Bring 3 [[Adamantine]] to the Cave Diver.
}}

{{Quest
|Quest = Underground Passage [6]
|QuestSub = Repair the boat to traverse the flooded cavern.
|QuestStep1 = Talk to the Cave Diver.
|Rewards = {{$|0}} • {{EXP|1,000,000}} • {{Meteor Shards|1,000}} • Unlock passage to {{Sunscorched Desert}}
}}

== Dialogue ==
=== Astral Caverns ===
{{Dialogue Start}}
:Whew, barely got outta there with my life.
:I'll need something stronger to get through...
{{Choice|What happened?}}
:I've been trying to explore this passage for months now, but it's flooded!
:I tried sailing through, but the waters are way too rough for my old boat.
:I've got some plans for an upgrade, mind helping me find the materials?
{{Choice|Sure!}}
::Awesome! First, I'll need to upgrade the frame.
::The rapids are way too strong for any normal boat, so...
::Grab me some Palladium and Mythril, that should do the trick.
::;Quest started: '''Underground Passage [1]'''
{{Choice|Nah, I like staying alive}}
::...Understandable.
-----
{{Action|Quest part [2]}}
:Great work!
:Next, I need fuel that burns even under the harshest conditions.
:I think some Inferlume and Volcanic Cores would be good enough.
:;Quest started: '''Underground Passage [3]'''
-----
{{Action|Quest part [4]}}
:Now, no regular engine would be able to handle this fuel.
:Only an engine of Umbrite and Adamantine would.
:I'll need a bit of that.
:;Quest started: Underground Passage [5]'''
-----
{{Action|Quest part [5] complete}}
:I see you have what I'm looking for. Would you like to submit them?
{{Choice|Yes}}
::That looks like it!
{{Choice|No}}
<div style="padding-left:2em;">
{{Action|No item in hand}}
::Hold out the item if you have it!
{{Action|Incorrect item in hand}}
::This isn't the right item.
{{Action|One of the correct ores in hand}}
::That looks like it!
</div>
-----
{{Action|Quest part [6]}}
:Haha, we're done!
:Hopefully it won't sink this time.
:Talk to me again when you're ready to travel.
:;Quest rewards: {{$|0}} • {{EXP|1,000,000}} • {{Meteor Shards|1,000}}
{{Choice|Isn't this kinda overkill?}}
::Trust me, it's ROUGH down there.
::We'll need all we can get.
{{Choice|...This time?}}
::Those were test runs! Don't worry about it.
-----
{{Action|After quest is completed}}
:Ready to travel?
{{Choice|Yes.}}
::Alright, here we go!
{{Choice|No.}}
::Bye!
{{Dialogue End}}

=== Sunscorched Desert ===
[[File:Cave Diver in Desert.png|400px|thumb|The Cave Diver on the other end of the trip]]
{{Dialogue Start}}
:Huh. Did not expect to end up here.
:Want to go back?
{{Choice|Yes.}}
::Alright, here we go!
{{Choice|No.}}
::Bye!
{{Dialogue End}}


