{{Tocright}}

The '''Trader''' is a [[:Category:Quests|quest-giving]] [[NPCs|NPC]] located in {{Rubble Creek}}.  
She offers special orders where you bring rare [[Minerals|gems]] for her clients. Some orders grant [[Permanent_Buffs#Trader's_Recommendation|permanent sell value buffs]].

During the Summer Event, the Trader was the best source for {{Sand Dollars|Sand Dollars}}, because she handled the [[Seashell_Isle#Summer_Collection|Summer Collection]].

== Quests ==
{{Quest
|Quest = Special Order (1)
|QuestSub = Bring a gemstone to the Trader.
|QuestStep1 = Bring a [[Minerals|Ruby]] to the [[Trader]]
|Rewards = {{$|30,000}} • {{EXP| 2,000}} • {{Meteor Shards|25}}
}}

{{Quest
|Quest = Special Order (2)
|QuestSub = A rarer request.
|QuestStep1 = Bring an [[Minerals|Emerald]] to the [[Trader]]
|Rewards = {{$|200,000}} • {{EXP| 10,000}} • {{Meteor Shards|50}}
|Buffs = [[File:Trader's Recommendation.png|20px|link=Permanent_Buffs#Trader's_Recommendation]] '''Trader's Recommendation''': +10% Sell Boost (Permanent)
}}

{{Quest
|Quest = Special Order (3)
|QuestSub = The biggest order yet.
|QuestStep1 = Bring a [[Minerals|Diamond]] to the [[Trader]]
|Rewards = {{$|1,000,000}} • {{EXP| 25,000}} • {{Meteor Shards|200}}
|Buffs = [[File:Trader's Recommendation.png|20px|link=Permanent_Buffs#Trader's_Recommendation]] '''Trader's Recommendation''': +10% Sell Boost (Permanent)
}}

== Dialogue ==

=== Special Order (1) ===
{{Dialogue Start}}
:'''Trader:''' Hah... I need a ruby for my client's order, but nobody here has one!  
:'''Trader:''' They can't be that rare, right?  

:{{Choice|I can find one for you.}}  
::'''Trader:''' Really? That would be great! Find it quick though, I need it soon.  
::;(Quest started: '''Special Order (1)''')  

:{{Choice|That’s crazy.}}  
::'''Trader:''' RIGHT? Like come on—  
::'''Trader:''' Hey, are you even listening?  

;{{Action|While quest is active}} 
:'''Trader:''' Did you find it yet? Just hold it out and show it to me.  

;{{Action|Holding wrong item}}
:'''Trader:''' That's not a ruby. You trying to scam me?

;{{Action|Quest complete}}  
:'''Trader:''' Wow, you actually found one? Here, take this as payment!  
{{Dialogue End}}

----

=== Special Order (2) ===
{{Dialogue Start}}
:'''Trader:''' Another order just came in... and they want an EMERALD?  
:'''Trader:''' Hey, you found a ruby, right?
:'''Trader:''' Surely you can find an emerald, right?  

:{{Choice|Yes.}}  
::'''Trader:''' Whew... I'll trust you then.  
::;(Quest started: '''Special Order (2)''')  

:{{Choice|No.}}  
::'''Trader:''' ... Guess I'm getting fired.  

;{{Action|While quest is active}} 
:'''Trader:''' Did you find it yet? Just hold it out and show it to me.  

;{{Action|Holding wrong item}}
:'''Trader:''' That's not an emerald...

;{{Action|Quest complete}} 
:'''Trader:''' Wow, thanks! You really saved my skin there!  
:'''Trader:''' I'll put in a good word to the traders for you as well.  
:'''Trader:''' You should be able to get better deals when selling.  
{{Dialogue End}}

----

=== Special Order (3) ===
{{Dialogue Start}}
:'''Trader:''' Now I need to find a DIAMOND? WHAT?  
:'''Trader:''' Do they want me to get fired?  

:{{Choice|Hah, I can easily find that. Light work.}}  
::'''Trader:''' Pfft. There's no way... Well, if you really want to try, I won't stop you.  
::;(Quest started: '''Special Order (3)''')  

:{{Choice|...}}  
::'''Trader:''' Maybe the shopkeeper over there is hiring...  

;{{Action|While quest is active}} 
:'''Trader:''' Did you find it yet? Just hold it out and show it to me.  

;{{Action|Holding wrong item}}
:'''Trader:''' That's not a diamond.

;{{Action|Quest complete}}  
:'''Trader:''' WHAT? You actually found a diamond???  
:'''Trader:''' Here, take this payment, I NEED that!  
:'''Trader:''' I'll recommend you to the trading group as well.  
:'''Trader:''' You'll make even more money from selling now.  
{{Dialogue End}}

----

;{{Action|After all quests complete}}  
:'''Trader:''' Finally done with all those orders...  

----
=== Summer Collection ===
{{Dialogue Start}}
:'''Trader:''' Hey, [Player name]!
:'''Trader:''' Here to enjoy your summer?
:{{Choice|I'm looking for Sand Dollars.}}
:'''Trader:''' You're in luck! I've found a client who offers exactly that!
:'''Trader:''' They're looking for ores with Tidal and Summer modifiers.
:'''Trader:''' If you find any, place them in the crates over there. The rarer, the better!
:'''Trader:''' It'll take me a while to process the delivery, so make sure you submit the best ones!
{{Dialogue End}}

