pages.Surfer:
[[File:Surfer.png|thumb|280px|''the '''Surfer''', angered by prospectors'']]
{{Tocright}}

The '''Surfer''' is an [[NPCs|NPC]] first found at {{Sunset Beach}}. He wants to enjoy a peaceful vacation, but the influx of prospectors frustrates him.  

During the Summer Event, he relocates to {{Seashell Isle}} — only to encounter the player again, which makes him even angrier.

(Before the Caldera Park update, he was also found on the shores of the volcano, but once he didn't need to swim to get there, he abandoned that idea.)

