{{Dialogue Start}}
:'''Surfer:''' Ugh… all these prospectors are ruining my vacation!  
:{{Choice|Sorry about that.}}  
::'''Surfer:''' Sorry doesn’t give me my peace and quiet back.  

:{{Choice|You could always leave.}}  
::'''Surfer:''' And go where? Everywhere’s crawling with you lot.  
{{Dialogue End}}

=== Seashell Isle ===
{{Dialogue Start}}
:'''Surfer:''' I came here to escape the prospectors…  
:'''Surfer:''' But LOOK WHO’S HERE. ANOTHER PROSPECTOR.  
:{{Choice|Hey, I'm allowed here too!}}
:'''Surfer:''' You'd BETTER not ruin the beach with your filthy digging.
