pages.Vagrant:
[[File:Vagrant.png|thumb|280px|''the '''Vagrant''' in {{Fortune River Town}}'']]
{{Tocright}}

The '''Vagrant''' is an [[NPCs|NPC]] located in {{Fortune River Town}}.  
They can be found in a shack behind the [[Merchant]].  They also show up at {{Seashell Isle}} during the Summer Event.

They are a persistent character who claims to be down on their luck, constantly asking for "one last favor" in the form of heavy [[Gold]] chunks. Despite their frequent promises to pay you back "one day," they seem much better at collecting donations than settling their debts, leaving generous prospectors with nothing but experience and shards for their charity.

