::'''Vagrant:''' Thank you! I’ll definitely pay you back.  
::;(Quest started: '''Charity Work (3)''')  

:{{Choice|No.}}  
::'''Vagrant:''' Just one more time!  

:{{Choice|Absolutely not.}}  
