== Quest ==
{{Quest
|Quest = Eye of the Sands
|QuestSub = The resting traveler is searching for an ancient artifact.
|QuestStep1 =Bring 1 [[Eye of the Sands]] to the Resting Traveler.
|Rewards = {{$|25,000,000,000}} • {{EXP|5,000,000}} • [[Blueprint#Lunar_Mask_Blueprint|1 Blueprint]] • {{Meteor Shards|1,000}}
}}

== Dialogue ==
{{Dialogue Start}}
:Are you traveling to the Mystic Floodplains?
:If so, I have a favor to ask.
{{Choice|What is it?}}
:I've been searching for a special artifact left behind by the old Empire of the Sands.
:I've narrowed down its location to the Mystic Floodplains up ahead.
:Unfortunately, I've ran out supplies<ref>[stet]</ref>, so I won't be able to reach it.
:Since you seem to be going there, can you try searching for it?
{{Choice|Sure!}}
::Great! I have a good reward prepared if you can find it.
::;(Quest 'Eye of the Sands' started!)
{{Choice|Sorry, I'm busy}}
::Unfortunate. Safe travels, then.
-----
{{Action|While quest is in progress}}
:Hold out the artifact if you have it!
-----
{{Action|Quest completion}}
:I see you have what I'm looking for. Would you like to submit them?
{{Choice|Yes}}
::You found it? Perfect!
::Here are some of the treasures I found on my travels.
::;(Quest 'Eye of the Sands' completed!)
::They aren't of value to me, anyways.
{{Choice|No}}
<div style="margin-left:2em;">
{{Action|Not holding anything}}
::Hold out the artifact if you have it!
{{Action|Holding wrong thing}}
::This isn't the right item.
{{Action|Holding right thing}}
::You found it? Perfect!
::Here are some of the treasures I found on my travels.
::;(Quest 'Eye of the Sands' completed!)
::They aren't of value to me, anyways.
</div>
-----
{{Action|After quest completion}}
:Thanks for the help. Safe travels.
{{Dialogue End}}

